---
<% 
const isMetavuln = item.problem && item.chain
const advisory = isMetavuln ? item.problem : item
const chain = isMetavuln ? item.chain : []
%>
### <%- advisory.title %>

| Field | Details |
| --- | --- |
| **Source Package** | `<%- advisory.name %>` |
<%if(isMetavuln){%>| **Dependency Chain** | `<%- chain.join(' -> ') %>` |<%}%>| **Affected Versions** | `<%- advisory.range %>` |
| **CWE Classification** | <%- advisory.cwe.join(', ') %> |
| **CVSS Score** | <%- advisory.cvss.score %> |
| **CVSS Vector** | `<%- advisory.cvss.vectorString %>` |
| **Details Link** | [<%- advisory.url %>](<%- advisory.url %>) |
